<BaseLayout title="About & Disclosure | OopbuyTop" description="How OopbuyTop sources catalog data and handles partner links.">
 <article class="prose">
  <p class="eyebrow">Transparency · Reviewed August 29, 2026</p>
  <h1>About OopbuyTop</h1>
  <p>OopbuyTop is an independent product-discovery and research resource. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Oopbuy, Reddit, marketplaces, sellers or shopping agents. Our purpose is to help visitors move from a broad product idea to a smaller, more checkable shortlist.</p>
  <h2>How we research a page</h2>
  <p>Catalog cards are created from a build-time product-data snapshot. We organize the available title, category, price context, preview image and QC-photo count where available. A card is a discovery lead, not a guarantee of stock, price, size, quality, authenticity or delivery outcome.</p>
  <p>Guides explain a repeatable research step: compare the live option, check measurements, review warehouse photos and read the current parcel screen. Buyer-share pages link back to their original public Reddit discussion and distinguish Oopbuy orders from comparison-only community references.</p>
  <h2>What we update—and what you must verify</h2>
  <p>We review the site when product data, navigation or editorial guidance changes. A publication or review date means the page itself was checked; it does not mean every product listing or shipping option is current at the moment you read it.</p>
  <p>Before ordering, verify the live destination’s exact variant, price, seller chart, photos, restrictions and checkout terms. Before submitting a parcel, verify the items in your own order and the live shipping information shown for your destination.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
  <p>Some product links take visitors to third-party listings. We may earn a commission from qualifying referrals, at no extra cost to you. Sponsored destination links are identified in the site markup. A commercial relationship does not let us present a changed listing, personal Reddit post or past shipping experience as a promise.</p>
  <h2 id="privacy">Privacy and optional analytics</h2>
  <p>We ask before loading optional analytics cookies. If you accept, analytics can measure page visits and voluntary outbound-click placements so we can understand which research paths are useful. We do not use analytics to collect purchase details, payment information, account credentials or content you enter on a third-party destination. If you decline, the optional analytics script does not load.</p>
  <p>Outgoing sponsored links may include referral parameters so the destination can attribute a visit to OopbuyTop. Those parameters are part of the destination URL and are separate from optional analytics cookies on this site.</p>
  <h2>Editorial boundaries</h2>
  <p>We do not invent buyer reviews, usernames, photos, QC results, stock status, delivery time or prices. We do not grade authenticity or guarantee that a product, parcel, carrier or seller will meet a particular result. When a source is not an Oopbuy order, we label it as a community reference rather than using it as Oopbuy evidence.</p>
  <h2>Corrections and source context</h2>
  <p>If a live link no longer matches a card, the live page takes priority. If a public source changes or disappears, readers should rely on the original source where it remains available. This site’s guides are educational context, not purchase, customs, legal or shipping advice.</p>
 </article>
